{"name":"Elmwood","status":"ok","title":"Elmwood","pageId":25766,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Elmwood</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Settlement</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonsea\" title=\"Moonsea\">Moonsea</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/North_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"North Faerûn\">North Faerûn</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p49_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p49-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Village<sup id=\"cite_ref-RT.MM_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RT.MM-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dwarves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dwarves\">Dwarves</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">half-elves</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">humans</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p51_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p51-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eldath\" title=\"Eldath\">Eldath</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p51_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p51-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fish, woodcarvings<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p49_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p49-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Constable<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p49_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p49-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">500<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.PG-p22_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.PG-p22-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1367_DR\" title=\"1367 DR\">1367&#160;DR</a><br>500<sup id=\"cite_ref-RT.MM_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RT.MM-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Constable</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thoyana_Jorgadaul\" title=\"Thoyana Jorgadaul\">Thoyana Jorgadaul</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p49_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p49-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1367_DR\" title=\"1367 DR\">1367&#160;DR</a><br><a href=\"/wiki/Thoyana_Jorgadaul\" title=\"Thoyana Jorgadaul\">Thoyana Jorgadaul</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-RT.MM_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RT.MM-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Elmwood\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Elmwood\">Inhabitants of  Elmwood</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Elmwood\" title=\"Category:Locations in Elmwood\">Locations in  Elmwood</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Elmwood (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9FbG13b29kP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Organizations in  Elmwood</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Events in Elmwood (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6RXZlbnRzX2luX0VsbXdvb2Q/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Events in  Elmwood</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Food_and_drink_from_Elmwood\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Food and drink from Elmwood\">Food and drink from  Elmwood</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Items_from_Elmwood\" title=\"Category:Items from Elmwood\">Items from  Elmwood</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Elmwood</b> was a small farming community located on the southern shores of the <a href=\"/wiki/Moonsea\" title=\"Moonsea\">Moonsea</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-RT.MM_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RT.MM-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Notable_locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notable locations</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Inns_and_taverns\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inns and taverns</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Temples\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Temples</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Other_locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other locations</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Rumors_&_Legends\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rumors &amp; Legends</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This tranquil place was loosely ruled by its constable, <a href=\"/wiki/Thoyana_Jorgadaul\" title=\"Thoyana Jorgadaul\">Thoyana Jorgadaul</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_dwarf\" title=\"Shield dwarf\">shield dwarf</a> adventurer who retired here due to a respiratory disease.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p49-50_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p49-50-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Elmwood's merchant area was located in the center of the village.\n</p>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"new\" title=\"Docks (Elmwood) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRG9ja3NfKEVsbXdvb2QpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Docks</span></dt>\n<dd>Busiest part of the village located on the northern part of Elmwood; it was made by a series of wooden docks and piers where both village boats and passing merchant vessels moored. Near the Docks, three robust structures made by oak and brick were used as warehouses.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p50-51_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p50-51-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"new\" title=\"Grange (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR3JhbmdlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Grange</span></dt>\n<dd>A wood and stone emporium run by <a href=\"/wiki/Tayrom_Onetry\" title=\"Tayrom Onetry\">Tayrom Onetry</a>, where a trader could find nearly everything, except for armor and weapons.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p50-51_6-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p50-51-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Elmwood was founded in the <a href=\"/wiki/163_DR\" title=\"163 DR\">Year of the Screeching Vole, 163 DR</a>, as a stopover for ships to and from the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Lis\" title=\"River Lis\">River Lis</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p49_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p49-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It was accidentally destroyed in <a href=\"/wiki/1491_DR\" title=\"1491 DR\">1491 DR</a> when a <i><span class=\"new\" title=\"Devastation orb (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGV2YXN0YXRpb25fb3JiP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">devastation orb</span></i> intended to be set off in <a href=\"/wiki/Mulmaster\" title=\"Mulmaster\">Mulmaster</a> prematurely detonated there, leaving only a single survivor to report the tragedy.<sup id=\"cite_ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_locations\">Notable locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inns_and_taverns\">Inns and taverns</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inns and taverns\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inns and taverns\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Still_Waters\" title=\"Still Waters\">Still Waters</a></dt>\n<dd>Inn located on the eastern part of the village and run by master brewer, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Enrad Daleborn (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRW5yYWRfRGFsZWJvcm4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Enrad Daleborn</span>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p51_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p51-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Temples\">Temples</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Temples\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Temples\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Temple_of_the_Half-Moon\" title=\"Temple of the Half-Moon\">Temple of the Half-Moon</a></dt>\n<dd>Temple of <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a> run by <a href=\"/wiki/Alamarayne_Moonray\" title=\"Alamarayne Moonray\">Alamarayne Moonray</a>, a beautiful <a href=\"/wiki/Half-elf\" title=\"Half-elf\">half-elf</a> woman of <a href=\"/wiki/Moon_elf\" title=\"Moon elf\">moon elf</a> stock, and a close friend to Thoyana Jorgadaul.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p51_3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p51-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"new\" title=\"Grove (Elmwood) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR3JvdmVfKEVsbXdvb2QpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Grove</span></dt>\n<dd>South of Elmwood, hidden amidst the trees, the <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">druid</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ezril_Treewarder\" title=\"Ezril Treewarder\">Ezril Treewarder</a> tended a shrine dedicated to <a href=\"/wiki/Eldath\" title=\"Eldath\">Eldath</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p51_3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p51-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_locations\">Other locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Other locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Other locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"new\" title=\"Old Well (Elmwood) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvT2xkX1dlbGxfKEVsbXdvb2QpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Old Well</span></dt>\n<dd>South of the Still Waters, near the southeastern edge of the village, lay an ancient stone well, dried long time ago, that lead to an underground, monster infested area of Elmwood.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p51-54_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p51-54-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"border-box border-box-runes\" style=\"width:300px; float:right;margin-left:10px; text-align:left;\">\n<div class=\"frquote border-box-contentarea border-box-contentarea-runes\" style=\"display:flex;\">\n<div class=\"quotesymbol border-box-content border-box-content-runes\" style=\"color:#A0522D; line-height:32px;\">“</div>\n<div class=\"quotetext border-box-content border-box-content-runes\" style=\"font-size:inherit;\"><i>The old Moonsea saying \"like an Elmwood watch\" means a task so simple that it practically performs itself.</i></div>\n<div class=\"quotesymbol border-box-content border-box-content-runes\" style=\"color:#A0522D; align-self:flex-end; line-height:25px;\">”</div>\n</div><div class=\"quotesource border-box-content border-box-contentarea border-box-contentarea-runes\">—&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/John_Terra\" title=\"John Terra\">John Terra</a>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Moonsea_(accessory)\" title=\"The Moonsea (accessory)\">The Moonsea</a></i><sup id=\"cite_ref-tM.RG-p49_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tM.RG-p49-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The village was home to woodcutters and fishermen, and a waystop for ships and adventurers passing by. The place was neutral and the people kept to themselves, protected both by their isolation and the fact that there was little worth taking by force.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS2e-p65_9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS2e-p65-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Rumors_.26_Legends\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rumors_&_Legends\">Rumors &amp; Legends</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Rumors & Legends\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Rumors & Legends\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The residents of Elmwood told legends of a vicious <a href=\"/wiki/Dragon_turtle\" title=\"Dragon turtle\">dragon turtle</a>, the size of their town, who dwelt in the depths of the lake.<sup id=\"cite_ref-nwnt_10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-nwnt-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=10\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=11\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dt>Video Games</dt>\n<dd><i><a href=\"/wiki/Neverwinter_Nights:_Tyrants_of_the_Moonsea\" title=\"Neverwinter Nights: Tyrants of the Moonsea\">Neverwinter Nights: Tyrants of the Moonsea</a></i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elmwood?veaction=edit&section=12\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Gallery\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"c30c7cfd57891f2b1c110635d179e6ed\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><i>A map of Elmwood from the Interactive Atlas.</i></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-sectio